<title>USA: Hello Direct sees Q3 revs around $13 mln.</title>
<headline>Hello Direct sees Q3 revs around $13 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hello Direct Inc said it expects third quarter sales to be in line with analyst expectations of about $13 million. In last year's third quarter, it had sales of $9.3 million.</p>
<p>The company also said it expects the cash position at the end of the quarter &quot;to remain strong, at about $11 million.&quot;</p>
</text>
